### 🔄 Changed 🔄 Changed

#### 🏗️ Architecture 🏗️ Architecture- Refactored `madilang/cli/main.py` from monolithic (~500 lines) to modular dispatcher (~120 
#### lines).
- Refactored `madilang/cli/main.py` from monolithic (~500 lines) to modular dispatcher (~120 lines).- Moved all command logic 
to independent modules in `madilang/cli/commands/`. - Updated `madilang/__init__.py` to expose `run_diagnostics` and 
multi-target `get_generator`. - Bumped `__version__` to `"0.5.0"`. - Moved all command logic to independent modules in 
`madilang/cli/commands/`. - Updated `madilang/__init__.py` to expose `run_diagnostics` and multi-target `get_generator`.#### 📦 
Configuration - Updated `pyproject.toml` to v0.5.0 with Python 3.13 classifier. - Added `python` optional dependency group for 
FastAPI/Uvicorn/Pydantic. - Added Dev.to article and Changelog URLs to project metadata. - Expanded keywords: `fastapi`, 
`termux`, `diagnostics`. - Upgraded Development Status from Alpha to Beta. - Bumped `__version__` to `"0.5.0"`.
#### 🛡️ Generator Base 📦 Configuration- Added `list_generators()` convenience function to `madilang/generators/base.py`.
- Updated `pyproject.toml` to v0.5.0 with Python 3.13 classifier.
- Added `python` optional dependency group for FastAPI/Uvicorn/Pydantic.
- Added Dev.to article and Changelog URLs to project metadata.
- Expanded keywords: `fastapi`, `termux`, `diagnostics`.
- Upgraded Development Status from Alpha to Beta.

#### 🛡️ Generator Base
- Added `list_generators()` convenience function to `madilang/generators/base.py`.
- Enhanced `GenerationResult` with structured error reporting.

